From 18bea9b3242d0f099155a6be761273dca55132bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Gillinger <christian.gillinger@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:07:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] genesys: GL126, name the gl124 files the GL126 files
 derive from

gl126.cpp, gl126.h and gl126_registers.h started as copies of the gl124
files and were then rewritten for the GL126. Little of the original
remains, but the headers named only the new author. Say where the files
come from and keep the original copyright lines.

Also correct the banner of the generated tables. It said that reads and
polls are not reproduced, which was true before the op programs
existed.

No code changes.
---
 backend/genesys/gl126.cpp         | 2 ++
 backend/genesys/gl126.h           | 2 ++
 backend/genesys/gl126_registers.h | 2 ++
 backend/genesys/gl126_tables.cpp  | 5 +++--
 backend/genesys/gl126_tables.h    | 5 +++--
 5 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/backend/genesys/gl126.cpp b/backend/genesys/gl126.cpp
index 539f650d0..1cd65b190 100644
--- a/backend/genesys/gl126.cpp
+++ b/backend/genesys/gl126.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 /* sane - Scanner Access Now Easy.
 
    Copyright (C) 2026 Christian Gillinger
+   Portions derived from gl124.cpp,
+   Copyright (C) 2010-2016 Stéphane Voltz <stef.dev@free.fr>
 
    This file is part of the SANE package.
 
diff --git a/backend/genesys/gl126.h b/backend/genesys/gl126.h
index feec07aa9..416bb6950 100644
--- a/backend/genesys/gl126.h
+++ b/backend/genesys/gl126.h
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 /* sane - Scanner Access Now Easy.
 
    Copyright (C) 2026 Christian Gillinger
+   Portions derived from gl124.h,
+   Copyright (C) 2010-2016 Stéphane Voltz <stef.dev@free.fr>
 
    This file is part of the SANE package.
 
diff --git a/backend/genesys/gl126_registers.h b/backend/genesys/gl126_registers.h
index 3521c6d88..ec5290f66 100644
--- a/backend/genesys/gl126_registers.h
+++ b/backend/genesys/gl126_registers.h
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 /* sane - Scanner Access Now Easy.
 
    Copyright (C) 2026 Christian Gillinger
+   Portions derived from gl124_registers.h,
+   Copyright (C) 2019 Povilas Kanapickas <povilas@radix.lt>
 
    This file is part of the SANE package.
 
diff --git a/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.cpp b/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.cpp
index d1e985c09..aca107e23 100644
--- a/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.cpp
+++ b/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.cpp
@@ -24,8 +24,9 @@
  *
  * Register values captured from the vendor driver and verified
  * byte-exact against USB traces; these are interoperability
- * facts, not vendor code. Reads and polls are not reproduced
- * here: the backend polls explicitly with timeouts.
+ * facts, not vendor code. The register tables hold the writes
+ * only; the op programs carry every transfer in order, with the
+ * waits as explicit polls with timeouts.
  *
  * Protocol notes and the reverse-engineering record:
  * https://github.com/cgillinger/opticfilm135i-linux
diff --git a/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.h b/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.h
index 321890e28..33bd6d6df 100644
--- a/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.h
+++ b/backend/genesys/gl126_tables.h
@@ -24,8 +24,9 @@
  *
  * Register values captured from the vendor driver and verified
  * byte-exact against USB traces; these are interoperability
- * facts, not vendor code. Reads and polls are not reproduced
- * here: the backend polls explicitly with timeouts.
+ * facts, not vendor code. The register tables hold the writes
+ * only; the op programs carry every transfer in order, with the
+ * waits as explicit polls with timeouts.
  *
  * Protocol notes and the reverse-engineering record:
  * https://github.com/cgillinger/opticfilm135i-linux
